# This folder is deployed inside an existing WordPress install
# (public_html/ppc/services/google-ads-management/). WordPress's root
# .htaccess only rewrites requests that don't match a real file or folder,
# so it will not interfere with the files here - this .htaccess just makes
# sure index.html is served as the default document for this folder on
# every hosting configuration.

DirectoryIndex index.html

# Prevent directory listing if DirectoryIndex ever fails to resolve.
Options -Indexes
